--- body ---
## Context

Experiment X8 (SPEC.md §5.3) showed every candidate clearing the 0,999
cross-provider bar at full precision and most failing it at the 8-bit rungs
(0,970-0,998 mean cosine; `bench/results/0482-gpu-corrected/
x8-cross-provider-fidelity.json`). As the rule is written, that supports the
adopt-a-foreign-index path only when both machines run fp32. Whether the rule
is right is untested: the bar is a compatibility proxy, and the question that
matters is whether a corpus embedded by one provider and queried by the other
at an 8-bit rung loses task recall, and how much.

The author held the adopt-by-copy ratification on exactly this (2026-08-30).

## Relevant files

- `SPEC.md` §5.3 — the X8 rule this may amend (an amendment is a ruling,
  not a report)
- `DECISIONS.md` — the awaiting adopt-a-foreign-index entry
- `bench/results/0482-gpu-corrected/` — the GPU vectors and X8 scores
- `bench/results/0263-cpu-arm/` and `/home/haduong/data/projets/
  zoteus-bench/0263-vectors/` — the CPU vectors
- `bench/results/0265-recall-fusion/` — the task-recall methodology to reuse

## Actions

1. For two or three candidates spanning the X8 range (one near 0,97, one near
   0,998, one that cleared), run the 0265 task-recall probe with the corpus
   vectors from one provider and the query vectors from the other, at the
   same 8-bit rung, against the same-provider baseline.
2. Report the recall delta beside the cosine score, per candidate. The
   finding is the mapping, not a verdict on any single model.
3. If the delta is inside the probe's noise, propose the bar's amendment to
   the author as a ratification question; if it is real, the fp32-only
   condition stands and the ledger entry can be ratified as drafted.

## Test

- Positive control: the same-provider arm must reproduce 0265's recall for
  that (candidate, rung) within noise, or the probe is not measuring what it
  claims.

## Verification

- [ ] The cosine-to-recall mapping reported for candidates spanning the bar
- [ ] Same-provider control reproduces the 0265 figure per cell

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Evidence sufficient for the author to ratify or amend the X8 bar, and
      to rule on adopt-by-copy, cited from the awaiting entry
